{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_16_level_main_16-03_beg","groupId":"main_16","stageId":"main_16-02","title":"道路以目","storyCode":"16-3","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_16-03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"6740f9240f42d4d366ee49bc893277cd8217405cc3540bd452682cca5bacd9dd","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"Raidian帶隊回到烏薩斯蒐集石棺的情報。遠北中心礦區的礦工們反殺糾察隊，想要離開礦區。為了拆除礦工們身上的定位晶片，礦工領袖雷爾金向當時正在礦區中的Raidian求助。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodescom"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>羅德島新基地，會議室</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關於石棺的線索？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們目前掌握的石棺的最後動向，是烏薩斯官方在切爾諾伯格-龍門事件之後，回收了全套石棺系統。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於他們後續到底準備如何運用石棺，似乎是保密更為嚴格的計劃，凱爾希的情報裡也完全沒有記錄。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們沒辦法直接向烏薩斯官方申請借用石棺……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們還有什麼可以鎖定石棺位置的方法？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當年切爾諾伯格研究所被破壞之後，從官方的名單上來看，除了那位謝爾蓋，整個研究所沒有其他倖存者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是透過研究謝爾蓋的後續經歷，我們可以發現些許線索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之後，謝爾蓋又成立了全新的研究石棺的研究所。就在這個研究所短暫運作的那段時間裡，我們發現了一個特殊的人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾喬姆·恰達耶夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個人在謝爾蓋的研究所裡擔任副所長，但是他過往的履歷卻一片空白，沒有任何可信的學術和政治背景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許我們可以合理推斷……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這個人和謝爾蓋有特殊的關係？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"這個人和研究所有特殊的關係？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管是哪一種情況，這個人都有可能是突破口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要找的，就是這位阿爾喬姆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，情況還要更複雜一點……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝爾蓋的研究所關閉之後，這個人的去向也很難追蹤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而根據凱爾希的私人情報，去年冬天，阿爾喬姆在聖駿堡皇家療養院去世了，死於心臟衰竭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"他到最後都和烏薩斯保持著不錯的關係。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"或許我們可以調查與他相關的人。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聰明的判斷！我也是這樣想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我們要找的，是與這位阿爾喬姆有關的另一位研究員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"科謝尼婭·馬爾科芙娜·涅留朵娃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相比之下，這位研究員的履歷較為詳細。在石棺事件發生前，她曾短暫地作為伊利亞的副手在切城研究所工作過，與凱爾希打過交道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根據我們瞭解到的最新消息，目前，她正在烏薩斯遠北地區，布列斯克下轄的遠北中心礦區研究所裡工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而那裡，正是阿爾喬姆臨終前寄出的最後幾封信件的收件地址。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"聽起來並不是一個十分可靠的線索……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"卻也是我們唯一的線索。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們應該去那座研究所找她。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我必須要提醒你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我們已經下定決心要把凱爾希帶回來，但我們必須考量每一次任務的風險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島現在已經無法承受多少損失了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"可是……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯至今依然是非常危險的地方，並且，這次任務我們掌握的情報十分有限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而羅德島重建工作剛剛起步，很多事務還需要博士和阿米婭參與決策。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian，我可以……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，阿米婭已經是很厲害的大人了，但正因為這樣，留守羅德島這項最重要的任務要交給阿米婭才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特蘭傳回的消息同樣令人不安，博士勢必要去處理。讓羅德島在新家園站穩腳跟，是我們目前最重要的任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說得對……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果只是潛入任務，那肯定是Misery的小隊更加擅長，但還要收集情報的話，還是我的小隊更專業。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何況，回烏薩斯行動的話，也沒有比我更適合的人選了，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來，Raidian的分析還是很有道理的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你決定吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這次的任務很危險。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"一定要注意安全，Raidian。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"羅德島不能再失去任何人了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然了，我們會以流動醫療隊的形式謹慎行動的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不在的時候，大家都要照顧好自己哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望每一個人，都能平安回家……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒼老的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“……我願意默想，並分擔他的痛苦。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒼老的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“一個人的痛苦是每個人的痛苦，一個人的罪過是每個人的罪過……”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒼老的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“願有罪的人都能誠心懺悔，其罪過都可被原諒，其靈魂都可被救贖……”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g4_miningarea_polluted"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>烏薩斯遠北中心礦區</><p=2>五天前</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的嚎叫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的嚎叫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊————！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年礦工","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的……奶奶，您，別害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年礦工","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，雷爾金，老師……他已經把，追過來的糾察隊，都趕走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年礦工","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們，暫時安全了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊……暫時。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還能去哪裡呢，我們該去哪裡尋求安寧呢……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年礦工","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶……您、您餓了嗎……？我去問一下霍里，再幫您拿一塊麵包。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事……乖孩子，我沒事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去看看雷爾金吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他做了最多的事，他的心靈也會變得千瘡百孔的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去看看他吧，不要讓他再背負更多……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年礦工","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師，他……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……呼……"},{"type":"narration","text":"昏暗的天幕下，青年肅殺的面容趨於平靜。\n陣雪很快消弭了礦鎬上熱血的溫度，眼前畏縮的敵人已全然潰退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別……別殺我！你們不能動我，我已經投降了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們還沒有接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我，像你們這樣的追兵，還有多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"該死，我不——我不知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"每一支糾察隊都是獨立的，我們之間基本不互相聯絡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再告訴我一點我不知道的事，不然我沒有讓你活著的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別、別動手！聽我說！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們身上的晶片！偵測晶片！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晶片？你是說偵測感染程度的晶片？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈……哈哈哈……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“高尚的雷爾金”、“英雄的雷爾金”，你真的這麼天真？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們身上的晶片，會把座標位置傳回礦區研究所和最近的衛兵哨所，在你們私自離開礦區，或者晶片從身體裡脫離的一瞬間——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“砰”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"炸掉一條腿還算最幸運的，兩條腿也有可能一起炸掉，畢竟這樣你們就跑不了了，哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金，你放棄吧……你們以為殺了一支糾察隊，就可以逃出這片礦場了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們逃不出去的……烏薩斯會永遠追殺你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"投降吧，這是保證你們不至於死得太悲慘的唯一辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金，不要聽他亂說！晶片要是會爆炸，早就有馱獸被晶片炸得斷手斷腳了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糾察隊都是畜生不如的東西，他們嘴裡的真話就跟冬天的蚜蟲一樣少！我還沒變成感染者的時候就見多了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金，你今天已經做得夠多了，讓我來殺了他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年礦工","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不要！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年礦工","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要再、再——殺人了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年礦工","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們……沒事！沒、沒有人，重傷……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年礦工","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先放開他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“小枝條”，你讓開！你幹嘛幫這個東西求情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寶麗娜就是被這些畜生逼死的，就只是因為她庇護了一個沒有登記的孩子……她被吊死的時候還懷著孕啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們做過多少沒良心的事，你都忘了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小枝條”","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃，咳、咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，謝謝你，“小枝條”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我記得你……你是最溫順的孩子，你會有一個好下場的，就算他們所有人——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小枝條”","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……至少我沒讓他在雪地裡失血而死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站穩了，別喬克。去後面，去幫我把那位醫生找來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保爾，你去找尼克托，告訴他，讓所有想離開礦區的人都集中到南宿舍區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓大家做好準備，我們必須拆除身上的晶片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的相信那傢伙說的話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論如何，我們都必須先拆掉晶片。就算爆炸是假的，定位也是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經有糾察隊找上來了，我們還無法確定下一波是什麼時候，這樣下去我們會非常被動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好……我聽你的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師，您、您答應……答應過，我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你還在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒答應過你任何事，別喬克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，如果其他糾察隊的畜生都死了，他憑什麼例外？憑他的傲慢？憑他的譏諷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……算了，你不懂。忘了我剛才說的話吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，這個你先拿去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個秒錶，我在研究所裡找到的，應該還能用。之後有空了，我教你認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以後，你不用再數著沒有意義的數字過活，擔心數漏一個就有人死在礦井下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於現在……去吧，別喬克。去幫我把人找來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師，您的手，在抖……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別說了，去做你該做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那麼，至少，讓我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"願您的……靈魂……得到……救贖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使你看見那些人怎麼對待我們，也看見我是怎麼要了他們的命？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是……是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要輕易祝福，更不要輕易寬恕，別喬克，即使是對我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快去吧，我們沒有時間了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g10_tent_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……雷爾金先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，塞拉菲娜女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我們認識的時間不長，但我願意相信，既然你的醫療小隊願意來到這片偏遠的地方幫助、治療感染者，你們一定是可以信任的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，我現在不得不拜託你一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請說吧，只要是我能幫得上忙的事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛才得知，這裡的每一位礦工，體內都有一枚隨時可能爆炸的定位晶片。為了擺脫糾察隊的追捕，我們必須想辦法把晶片取出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我準備從自己開始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我成功了，請你協助我幫其他人進行手術；如果它不幸爆炸了，請你對我實施急救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我因此死了……也請你把這件事告訴其他還在等著我的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，請你先離開這裡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，先讓我檢查一下，可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……很不幸，晶片可能會爆炸的說法是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你體內的晶片的確攜帶了微型的烈性源石炸藥，一旦晶片無法接收到礦區內或人體內的電訊號，就會觸發爆炸……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果大家想要從這片礦區撤離，恐怕都必須先拆除晶片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"厲害，這是你的源石技藝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許，我可以暫時操控相同的電訊號騙過晶片的訊號接收器。但我必須提醒你，這樣做依然有很大的風險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總不能等到每件事都萬無一失再行動……有你這個辦法就夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稍等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Raidian開始用源石技藝，使能量束以相同頻率與晶片中的訊號接收器共振。\n雷爾金點頭，坐下來緊握刀柄，感受冰涼、光滑、堅硬，使它與掌心的繭相碰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"醫生，你最好還是離我遠一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了，這是第一次嘗試，我必須即時注意情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以透過神經電訊號引導你手臂的動作，要小心，不要破壞晶片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"了不起……我有點遺憾沒有早點認識你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……希望我們還有交談的機會吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷爾金在匕首上倒了些酒，用刀刃對準腿上的疤痕，將其嵌入血肉裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……成功了，對吧？"},{"type":"narration","text":"青年礦工幾乎要一躍而起，甚至忘記了自己鮮血淋漓的傷口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請先冷靜一點，你的傷口需要包紮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，當然，謝謝你醫生，我欠你一條命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很厲害，我從來沒有見過像你這樣厲害的醫生，你甚至讓我想起了烏薩斯的軍人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我不理解你的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，請不要誤會，這是我能想到的最高尚的讚譽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是說，那些真正的烏薩斯軍人——與那些糾察隊的畜生不同，他們趕走了入侵的夢魘，推翻了駿鷹的暴政，是真正的英雄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，伊戈爾大帝的傳記，請問你看過嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們該繼續準備其他人的手術了——總共有多少人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……恐怕是會讓你和你的同伴有些勞累的數量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我操控的電訊號能完全覆蓋這一片區域，我的同伴們可以協助進行手術。這樣的話，我看我們需要在這裡停留一段時間了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的時間很緊迫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請醫療小隊優先去幫助老人和小孩，然後教其他人該怎樣做。把手術刀發給他們吧，我的同伴們從來不軟弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金先生，請你不要代替醫生做決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不，醫生，我並不是想指揮你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然我已經肩負帶領大家逃出這片礦區的重責大任，那我就需要做出相應的決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隨時可能追上來的糾察隊還有惡劣的天氣、緊缺的物資——都是要命的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望我們可以達成共識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……無論如何，都要小心感染，我的小隊會監督大家做好消毒步驟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就讓我們開始吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“先動起來，再談將來。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g3_miningarea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘔——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳！嘔……咳——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就受不了了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你之前在聖駿堡吃煙燻香腸的時候，是不是從來沒有想過它們是怎樣做出來的？或者你有沒有去看過衛星城裡的屠宰場？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去你的！*烏薩斯粗口*，雷爾金，你真該死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我吞了一肚子雪也蓋不住鼻腔裡的血腥味——下次我一定找機會在你的湯裡加最新鮮的馱獸血！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新鮮的馱獸血很貴，一桶要賣到一百多切爾文，我們現在買不起……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，我只是打個比方……霍里，我都不知道你還當過高級餐廳的廚師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我兒子在當卡車司機的時候運過這種東西，聖駿堡的貴族們相信馱獸幼獸的血可以用來美容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他在信中提到很多聖駿堡的事，但上一次寄信過來已經是七年前了，希望他過得還好……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我要拜託你小心點了，別讓尼克托對我的晚餐動手腳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會小心的，沒有人可以對大家的晚餐動手腳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"希望這不會是我們吃的最後一頓晚餐，不然我一定會詛咒你的，雷爾金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隨你怎麼說，今天我的心情很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我很久沒有這麼自由的感覺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們終於卸下了鐐銬，我們是自由的。我們想做的事、想去的地方、我們的生活，都只由我們自己決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你明明可以找個更安定的時候再吟詩的……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金，我們接下來該怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的計劃沒有變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去南邊，去烏卡邊境，找到那個由感染者建立，也只屬於感染者的農莊。那裡會有我們所有人的容身之處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是願意毫無理由地相信那個不知真假的“整合運動”……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我當然有理由相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前幾年我還在烏卡邊境值守的時候，聽到過許多關於他們的可靠消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們收容感染者，免費發放藥物，還把許多想要欺凌感染者的糾察隊打得落荒而逃——我相信有人和我們的理想是一致的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只會懷疑這是感染者自欺欺人的幻想，或者是軍隊編出來索討稅收的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只會好奇，像這樣的旗幟為什麼直到現在才被舉起來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果……如果我們發現他們不存在，那就由我們舉起這面旗幟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵……我原本以為在邊境的軍旅生涯會讓你得到更深的體悟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想像一下，要是當年你救的是那位伯爵大人，而不是那個感染者，你現在恐怕已經是中尉，甚至是上尉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像我們今天遇到的糾察隊，只要你勾勾手指，他們就會爬過來親吻你的靴子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我很感激我做出的選擇，否則我不會有機會看清這個國家的真實面貌，也不會意識到自己這一生最重要的使命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的人民已經在愚弄和蒙蔽下活了太久，他們認為自己眼前的生活就是理所應當的，完全忘了自己應得的是什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不只是感染者和普通人的矛盾，假如有一天烏薩斯的感染者都死光了，他們也會按另一套標準把一部分的人送到礦場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"憑什麼有些人生來就能擁有一切，另外一些人一輩子只能苟且求生？他們辛苦勞動取得的成果到底供養了誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是說到底，又是誰規定了什麼是“應得”的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許這片大地現在的樣貌就是真理，假使存在另外一個泰拉，假使文明發展推倒重來一萬遍，也離不開這套公式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……我不相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當你睜眼看到發生在我們周圍的一切時，你難道不會憤怒嗎？當我們本能地感到憤怒的時候，那就說明這一切都是錯的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尼克托，以你的經歷，你應該明白的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別再提那些陳年舊事了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了……就算像你說的那樣，我們現在離邊境還有多遠？這一路上我們還會遇到多少事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經有了一個計劃——你以為我為什麼要讓你收集這些晶片？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然它們不像其他的晶片那樣，摘出來就爆炸了，但這也代表它們的定位功能還沒有消失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，這些東西讓我們吃了不少苦頭，那我們為什麼不利用它們反將糾察隊一軍呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這和我們決定逃出去前說的不一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金，你應該清楚大家的狀態。現在還能動彈的人有多少？有原先的一半嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們能擊敗這些糾察隊一次兩次，但我們不可能對抗整個烏薩斯！製造更多的流血衝突只會讓我們陷入完全的被動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們想要活下去，走到這一步就只是時間問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多殺一個糾察隊的走卒，我們手中就至少能多一個備用的呼吸器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搶來的物資能幫助我們走出冰原，也能幫別喬克那樣的孩子多活幾天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我們能離開的契機是什麼，你難道忘了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使那東西都不算是個人，也是我們一起讓它沒命的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我不知道你在說什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們甚至還沒走出礦區，你就已經變得完全不可理喻了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尼克托，我不願意吵架——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老、老師……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，尼克托先生，您，也在……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒事。我只是來看看，老師有沒有吃飯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，那你可以少操一份心了，他的肚子已經被他宏偉的理想填飽了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈……他說得也不算錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多關心一下那幾位醫生朋友吧，今天最辛苦的是他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛剛，去看過他們了。他們，都準備，休息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，你也辛苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傷口怎麼樣，還痛嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……還好。大家，都一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我們每個人都很勇敢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去休息吧，去填飽肚子，然後好好睡一覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……我們，食物有限，我的飯量，不大……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師，您也要，注意身體……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金，“小枝條”很信任你，她一直把你當成老師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……大家都很信任你，他們都在等著你帶他們走出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，所以我告訴她的每一句話，都是我發自內心認同的真理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也在帶領大家走向我認為正確的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但願吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放輕鬆點，尼克托。今天是我們取得第一場勝利的日子，是一個好兆頭，沒必要這樣愁眉苦臉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當一個人因覺醒而決定出發的時候，就是一個偉大的開始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是《伊戈爾傳》裡說的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是我自己說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，尼克托，我們在做一件偉大的事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g10_tent_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，所有人的手術都已經完成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"條件有限，有些人已經開始發燒了，實在沒辦法避免……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了，之後我會去和他們的領袖協商，盡可能保障傷員的食物和水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天你們都辛苦了，儘快休息，也要注意自己的健康。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，我們接下來還要……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今遠北全面戒嚴，天氣也會影響通訊狀況，我們很難與外界取得聯絡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡發生的事一定會引來烏薩斯的注意，我們不能留下，必須儘快離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我們確定要跟他們一起行動嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，我很擔心，這樣下去我們會面臨與烏薩斯對立的局面……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，羅德島沒有立場與烏薩斯為敵，但是此時此刻在這裡的，也只是許多想要活下去的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"改變感染者的處境，這始終是羅德島的初衷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何況，這段時間我們也接受過他們不少幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先不用擔心了，盡可能做好應對意外的準備，我會繼續嘗試與城中據點取得聯絡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他們可以收到我們之前發出的消息……希望他們前來支援時，也能發現我們留下的線索吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g1_bleskstreet"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>烏薩斯遠北地區，布列斯克</><p=2>三天前</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的報童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"賣報紙哦——《布列斯克時報》——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的報童","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐……要不要買一份報紙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (B)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，好、好啊……請問多少錢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的報童","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"二十帕拉……可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (B)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (B)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我好像沒有零錢了……這個給你吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的報童","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝姐姐！你真是好人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米婭小心翼翼地將一枚一切爾文的硬幣放在孩子的手心裡，拿到錢的孩子好像生怕對方後悔一樣，一溜煙地消失在街角。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你在看什麼？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個孩子身上的衣服……好薄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布列斯克，比我印象中的烏薩斯，還要冷一點。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"上一次來烏薩斯的時候是冬天。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"布列斯克比切爾諾伯格還要更靠近北邊。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還記得那個時候……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是我第一次見到那樣激烈的戰場，甚至緊張得忘了害怕……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當時以為，再也不會有比那更危險的時刻了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"結果在那之後，我們又經歷了很多。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"至少現在沒有天災和追兵。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"至少現在我很清楚地知道自己是誰。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話說回來，博士，我們好像很少有機會像這樣靜靜地觀察一座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管是切爾諾伯格、龍門還是倫蒂尼姆，我們的記憶裡好像都充滿了動亂和戰火……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這才是這片大地本該有的樣子。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們應該記住這座城市現在的樣子。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"看看今天的報紙吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"上面有報導礦區封鎖的原因嗎？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許只有等阿洛伊澤小姐和那位女大公進行交涉後，才能知道更多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她說會幫我們申請進入礦區的許可，可是，她到底會怎麼做呢……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"她有意讓我們意識到我們掌握的消息十分有限。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"她想讓我們處於被動的局面。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面就是女大公的辦公場所了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從我們之前收集到的消息來看，這位女大公名叫葉莉薩維塔·康斯坦丁諾夫娜·拉齊薩拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和許多人印象中的烏薩斯貴族不同，這位女大公治理轄地的政策是以“仁慈”出名——不論是對普通人還是對感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從各個管道打聽到的消息中都提到了她的好名聲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"有這樣的好名聲，只是“仁慈”是不夠的。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"這位女大公應該也是個足夠聰明的人。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"她的辦公場所似乎不算宏偉。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"看起來像是一般民宅。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布列斯克的建築普遍比較低矮且整齊，可能是烏薩斯遠北特有的風格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，從地圖上來看，周邊建築都呈現出拱衛這棟樓的趨勢，至少從城市規劃角度來說，它確實有著相對獨特的地理位置。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"所以，我們還是在這裡了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"這次甚至沒讓我們進去等。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"一位雷厲風行的年輕女士。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"一位頗有聲望的地區領導者。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你很擔心嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老實說，我也是。即使阿洛伊澤小姐表明了態度，現在也不清楚她的真面目到底——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"（搖頭）","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"不覺得現在的情況很熟悉嗎？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……啊，你是在說龍門那次？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陳小姐的確算是個雷厲風行的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"難道不是“很難應付”嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我們把它當成“嚴格”的另一種說法吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這一點上，陳小姐無論對人對己都是一樣的，不管是那時，還是現在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了！其實在出發前，我們還收到了陳小姐的訊息。雖然她沒有明確提到自己的動向，但至少聽起來狀態還不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她聽說之前發生的事後，承諾如果羅德島需要，她就會回來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們結識了許多朋友。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"也有許多人離開了我們。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還記得，和陳小姐一起行動的時候，代表羅德島與魏長官交涉的，其實是凱爾希醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我還是會擔心，自己無法像凱爾希醫生那樣處理問題，或者促成與他人的合作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我們對烏薩斯如今的情況、對這位女大公，知道的並不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭 (A)","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們沒必要去做只有凱爾希才能做到的事。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"就做你自己吧，阿米婭。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們會有辦法的。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠北衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請問，哪一位是羅德島的Dr.{@nickname}？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠北衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女大公殿下有請。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
